# Two-turn context carry-over. Turn 1 establishes a token, turn 2 asks
# the model to recall it. If conversation history serialization breaks
# (turn 1's user message or assistant reply isn't included in turn 2's
# request), the recall fails and the assertion catches it.

spawn ./zig-out/bin/zag
wait_text /Welcome to zag/
wait_idle 500ms
send "Remember this token for the rest of our conversation: zag-ctx-token-PL9. Just acknowledge briefly." <Enter>
wait_idle 20s
send "What was the token I asked you to remember? Reply with just the token, nothing else." <Enter>
wait_idle 20s
expect_text /zag-ctx-token-PL9/
snapshot final
send "/quit" <Enter>
wait_exit
